WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.025
Check yourself with two questions.

2
00:00:02.025 --> 00:00:06.863
First: at noon on November first, record
one thousand and three is pending.

3
00:00:06.863 --> 00:00:07.550
Why?

4
00:00:07.550 --> 00:00:08.687
The answer is a.

5
00:00:08.687 --> 00:00:11.716
The ISC copy of the account
predates the change,

6
00:00:11.716 --> 00:00:14.588
so the client waits for
the next aggregation.

7
00:00:14.588 --> 00:00:17.575
After the grace period,
it becomes a mismatch.

8
00:00:17.575 --> 00:00:21.488
Second: under the business rule,
which update can close a finding?

9
00:00:21.488 --> 00:00:26.451
The answer is c: an update from the
verifier account that carries new evidence.

10
00:00:26.451 --> 00:00:30.287
Evidence alone, or the
verifier alone, isn't enough.

11
00:00:30.287 --> 00:00:32.946
The module page has two more questions,

12
00:00:32.946 --> 00:00:37.150
on a missing saved read and on why
the kit has no test for Gate 5.
